Dependency environments, model weights and compiled dependency binaries are
not included in this source release.

Recorded Meta SAM 3.1 results and Muse Spark Open explanations are identified
as model outputs. Their use remains subject to applicable provider terms and
third-party rights; this source-code license does not grant rights beyond
those held by the contributors. Historical Muse citations remain tied to
their original evidence package.

The separately supplied final-video narration and music are not source-code
assets and are not relicensed by LICENSE. Their permissions are handled
separately. See docs/submission/VIDEO.md and docs/submission/THIRD_PARTY.md.

The optional assisted final-placement feature provisions two unmodified BotFails
originals directly from the publisher. Its small packaged SAM rack-mask record is
explicitly sanitized, attributed AI output; no private paths or credentials are
included. See placement_assessment/assets/NOTICE.md and its pinned manifest for
source identity, modification and provider-output notices. No model is distributed.
